---
description: Scenario generation rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Scenario definitions belong in YAML under src/main/resources/scenarios.

Random generation must be based on explicit deterministic seed.

Do not spread Thread.sleep calls across business code.
All delays go through ScenarioScheduler.

Correlated logical cases use predictable shared business values.

Generator must not generate E2E_ID.
BAMN owns E2E_ID generation.

Required scenarios:
- happy
- delayed target
- missing target
- retry
- failed
- duplicate ce_id
- ambiguous business key
- invalid-contract
